        "routeSummary": "with VinWonder and Island Tour",
        "overviewText": "[Phu Quoc](https://indiatour.live/attractions/phu-quoc) isn’t just Vietnam’s largest island — it’s a tropical paradise waiting to be explored. This 5 Days, 4 Nights Phu Quoc tour takes you across the island — from the adventure parks of the North and the laid-back beaches of the Central coast to the island-hopping wonders of the South.\n\nWhile your stays are based in North and Central Phu Quoc, the itinerary covers top experiences across all three regions. From wildlife encounters at Vinpearl Safari to snorkeling in turquoise waters and scenic cable car rides — every day offers something new. Perfect for families, couples, and beach lovers seeking a short, unforgettable Vietnam escape.\n\n### Why Choose the Phu Quoc Tour Package\n\n- Stay in both North & Central Phu Quoc\n- Includes [VinWonder](https://indiatour.live/attractions/vinwonders-phu-quoc) & [Vinpearl Safari](https://indiatour.live/attractions/vinpearl-safari-phu-quoc)\n- 4 Island Tour + Hon Thom Cable Car Ride\n- All top attractions covered — no hidden costs\n- First-timer friendly — transfers, hotels, guide, breakfast sorted\n\n### **Top Tourist Places Covered in This 5-Day Phu Quoc Tour**\n\n####  **North Phu Quoc – Where the Fun Begins**\n#### \n- **[Grand World](https://indiatour.live/attractions/grand-world-phu-quoc)** – Vietnam’s version of Las Vegas with light shows, canal rides & shopping streets\n- **Vinpearl Safari** – A massive open zoo with exotic wildlife and animal shows\n- **[VinWonder Theme Park](https://indiatour.live/attractions/vinwonders-phu-quoc)** – Rides, water slides, and fantasy lands for all age groups\n\n#### **Central Phu Quoc – Chill by the Beach**\n#### \n- **[Long Beach](https://indiatour.live/attractions/long-beach-phu-quoc)** – Iconic sunset views and beach cafés\n- **Local Night Markets** – Seafood, souvenirs, and street food adventures\n- **Beachside Hotels** – Your perfect spot for laid-back mornings and sea views\n\n#### **South Phu Quoc – Island Hopping & Ocean Thrills**\n#### \n- **4 Island Tour** – Explore the turquoise waters and hidden islets of South Phu Quoc on a scenic boat ride\n- **Snorkeling & Scuba Diving Spots** – Discover colorful coral reefs and marine life in the south’s clear waters\n- **Sea Walker Experience** – Walk the ocean floor near Gam Ghi or May Rut island — no swimming required\n\n### **Unique Experiences You’ll Enjoy on This Trip**\n\n- **Hon Thom Cable Car Ride:** Take the world’s longest over-sea cable car ride with 360° views of the Gulf of Thailand.\n\n- **4 Island Hopping Tour:** Swim, snorkel, and relax across Phu Quoc’s prettiest islets on a shared boat ride.\n\n- **[Vinpearl Safari Experience](https://indiatour.live/attractions/vinpearl-safari-phu-quoc):** Witness animals roam freely and enjoy interactive wildlife shows.\n\n- **[VinWonder Theme Park Day](https://indiatour.live/attractions/vinwonders-phu-quoc):** Thrill rides, water slides, and themed worlds — all in one place.\n\n- **Evening at [Grand World](https://indiatour.live/attractions/grand-world-phu-quoc):** Soak in canal-side walks, night shows, and dazzling lights after sunset.\n\n- **Snorkeling Adventure:** Float above coral gardens and spot vibrant marine life in crystal-clear waters.\n    \n- **[Scuba Diving Experience](https://indiatour.live/attractions/scuba-diving-in-phu-quoc):** Go deeper and explore Phu Quoc’s underwater world with professional diving instructors.\n    \n- **Sea Walker Activity:** Walk on the ocean floor wearing a special helmet — no swimming skills needed!",
