      "routeSummary": "Hanoi, Da Nang & Ho Chi Minh",
      "overviewText": "This 9-day tour is the perfect way to experience the country in its full diversity — from the cultural charm of [Hanoi](https://indiatour.live/attractions/hanoi) to the vibrant energy of [Ho Chi Minh](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ho-chi-minh-saigon) City. You’ll cruise overnight on the emerald waters of [Halong Bay](https://indiatour.live/attractions/halong-bay), walk across [Da Nang](https://indiatour.live/attractions/da-nang)’s iconic [Golden Bridge](https://indiatour.live/attractions/golden-hand-bridge), explore the lantern-lit streets of Hoi An, and float through the tropical canals of the [Mekong Delta](https://indiatour.live/attractions/mekong-delta). Covering Vietnam’s top highlights across north, central, and south regions, this all-in-one itinerary is ideal for first-time visitors who want to see it all — comfortably, and without the hassle of planning. \n\n### **Why Choose Explore Vietnam**\n\n- Customisable tour with expert local guides\n- [Halong Bay](https://indiatour.live/attractions/halong-bay) cruise stay with all onboard meals\n- Includes Vietnam’s Must-Visit Attractions\n- Ideal for first-time travelers — transfers, hotels, guides, breakfast sorted\n- Comfort-first approach — not over-packed, just rightly balanced\n\n### **Top Tourist Places in Vietnam Covered in This Tour**\n\n- **[Hanoi](https://indiatour.live/attractions/hanoi):** Temple of Literature, Hoan Kiem Lake, Old Quarter strolls\n- **[Ninh Binh](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ninh-binh):** Boat ride at Trang An or Tam Coc, ancient capital Hoa Lu\n- **[Halong Bay](https://indiatour.live/attractions/halong-bay):** Surprising Cave, Titop Island, limestone karsts, cruise stay\n- **[Da Nang](https://indiatour.live/attractions/da-nang):** Marble Mountains, My Khe Beach, Ba Na Hills, Golden Bridge\n- **[Hoi An](https://indiatour.live/attractions/hoi-an):** Coconut Village, Japanese Covered Bridge, lantern-lit riverside\n- **[Ho Chi Minh City](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ho-chi-minh-saigon):** Notre-Dame Cathedral, Post Office, War Museum\n- **[Mekong Delta](https://indiatour.live/attractions/mekong-delta):** [Vinh Trang Pagoda](https://indiatour.live/attractions/vinh-trang-pagoda), Dragon, Unicorn, Phoenix & Tortoise Islands\n\n### **Unique Vietnam Experiences You’ll Enjoy on This Trip**\n\n- Overnight cruise on [Halong Bay](https://indiatour.live/attractions/halong-bay) — sunrise views from your cabin\n- Basket boat ride through Coconut Village's serene waterways\n- Walk across [Da Nang](https://indiatour.live/attractions/da-nang)’s Golden Bridge, held by giant hands\n- Sail through the [Mekong Delta](https://indiatour.live/attractions/mekong-delta), exploring island villages and temples\n- Enjoy [Hoi An](https://indiatour.live/attractions/hoi-an)’s glowing lantern streets by night\n- Visit ancient pagodas and imperial sites rich in heritage",
