      "overviewText": "This 7-day romantic Vietnam tour is crafted for couples looking to slow down, soak in nature, and enjoy a peaceful escape. You’ll float through limestone caves in [Ninh Binh](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ninh-binh), cruise overnight on [Halong Bay](https://indiatour.live/attractions/halong-bay), and enjoy golden sunsets from [Ba Na Hills](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ba-na-hills). With private transfers, beautiful stays, and unhurried moments built in, it’s the perfect mix of discovery and downtime.\n\n### **Why Choose This Romantic Vietnam Tour**\n\n- A private & relaxed itinerary ideal for honeymooners or couples\n- Overnight stay on a Halong Bay cruise with meals\n- Private arrivals, group sightseeing.\n\n### **Top Tourist Places in Vietnam Covered in This 7-Days Tour**\n\n- **[Hanoi](https://indiatour.live/attractions/hanoi)** – Explore the capital’s culture and café scene\n- **[Ninh Binh](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ninh-binh)** – Boat ride through lush karst landscapes\n- **[Halong Bay](https://indiatour.live/attractions/halong-bay)** – Overnight cruise among limestone islands\n- **[Da Nang](https://indiatour.live/attractions/da-nang)** – Coastal charm and central Vietnam base\n- **[Ba Na Hills](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ba-na-hills)** – Golden Bridge, cable car ride, Fantasy Park\n\n### **Unique Vietnam Experiences You’ll Enjoy on This Trip**\n\n- Boat cruise through the caves of **Trang An** ([Ninh Binh](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ninh-binh))\n- **Overnight stay** on a luxury Halong Bay cruise with onboard dining\n- **Walk on the iconic [Golden Hand Bridge](https://indiatour.live/attractions/golden-hand-bridge)** suspended in clouds\n- Scenic **[Ba Na Hills](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ba-na-hills) cable car ride**, one of the world’s longest\n- Private time to explore local cafés, beaches, or simply unwind",
