      "overviewText": "This 6 Days 5 Nights North and South Vietnam Tour is perfect for travellers who want a quick yet immersive introduction to Vietnam. Begin your journey in Hanoi — a city where history whispers through French-colonial streets — then venture to the tranquil rivers of Ninh Binh and the iconic [Halong Bay](https://indiatour.live/attractions/halong-bay).\n\nFly south to vibrant [Ho Chi Minh City](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ho-chi-minh-saigon), where modern buzz meets cultural depth. Drift through the lush canals of the [Mekong Delta](https://indiatour.live/attractions/mekong-delta) before wrapping up. This tour balances nature, history, and local life — all while keeping things relaxed, guided, and hassle-free.\n\n### **Why Choose the North and South Vietnam Tour**\n\n- Covers the best of North & South — [Hanoi](https://indiatour.live/attractions/hanoi), [Ninh Binh](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ninh-binh), Halong Bay, Ho Chi Minh & Mekong\n- Free day tour to [Ninh Binh](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ninh-binh) included\n- Sharing based boat ride to Dragon, Unicorn, Phoenix & Tortoise Islands\n- Cruise through [Halong Bay’s](https://indiatour.live/attractions/halong-bay) iconic limestone cliffs\n- Verified stays, airport transfers & English-speaking guide included\n\n### **Top Tourist Places in Vietnam Covered in This 6-Days Tour**\n\n- **[Hanoi](https://indiatour.live/attractions/hanoi)** – Vietnam’s charming capital with Old Quarter, lakes & culture\n- **[Ninh Binh](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ninh-binh)** – Enjoy boat rides through Tam Coc or Trang An, flanked by rice fields and limestone hills\n- **[Halong Bay](https://indiatour.live/attractions/halong-bay)** – Day cruise across emerald waters, with stops at **Surprising Cave** & **Titop Island**\n- **[Ho Chi Minh City](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ho-chi-minh-saigon)** – Explore Saigon’s historic landmarks and lively markets\n- **[Mekong Delta](https://indiatour.live/attractions/mekong-delta)** – Visit **[Vinh Trang Pagoda](https://indiatour.live/attractions/vinh-trang-pagoda)** and cruise to **Dragon, Unicorn, Phoenix & Tortoise Islands**\n\n### **Unique Vietnam Experiences You’ll Enjoy on This Trip**\n\n- Peaceful boat ride between limestone cliffs in [Ninh Binh](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ninh-binh)\n- Cruising past floating fishing villages in [Halong Bay](https://indiatour.live/attractions/halong-bay)\n- Exploring the lush, riverine life of [Mekong Delta](https://indiatour.live/attractions/mekong-delta)\n- Sipping Vietnamese coffee in [Hanoi](https://indiatour.live/attractions/hanoi)’s hidden cafes\n- Experiencing the urban pulse of Saigon’s markets and boulevards\n- Immersive local experiences, from culture to cuisine",
