      "overviewText": "This 6-day *North & Central Vietnam Tour* is the perfect balance of natural beauty and iconic landmarks. From Hanoi’s rich cultural charm to the golden sands of [Da Nang](https://indiatour.live/attractions/da-nang), you’ll explore Vietnam’s two most scenic regions.\n\nCruise through the emerald waters of [Halong Bay](https://indiatour.live/attractions/halong-bay), drift past limestone caves in Trang An, and ride one of the world’s longest cable cars to the famous [Golden Bridge](https://indiatour.live/attractions/golden-hand-bridge) at [Ba Na Hills](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ba-na-hills). Whether you’re strolling through Old Quarter lanes or standing above the clouds in Central Vietnam, this trip is equal parts relaxing and awe-inspiring — designed for curious travellers who want both heritage and highlands.\n\n### **Why Choose North and Central Vietnam Tour Package**\n\n- Covers both North and Central Vietnam in one seamless itinerary\n- FREE [Ba Na Hills](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ba-na-hills) cable car ride included (worth it for the views alone!)\n- Explore [Halong Bay](https://indiatour.live/attractions/halong-bay) and [Ninh Binh](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ninh-binh) in comfortable day trips\n- All transfers, entry tickets & sightseeing taken care of — zero stress\n- English-speaking guides to enrich your travel experience\n\n### **Top Tourist Places in Vietnam Covered in This 6-Days Tour**\n\n- **[Hanoi](https://indiatour.live/attractions/hanoi):** Explore Vietnam’s charming capital with its old-world streets, lakes, and colonial architecture\n- **[Ninh Binh](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ninh-binh) (Trang An):** A peaceful river journey through caves, cliffs & rice paddies — often called the “Halong Bay on land”\n- **[Halong Bay](https://indiatour.live/attractions/halong-bay):** Enjoy a scenic day cruise through towering limestone karsts and tranquil waters\n- **[Da Nang](https://indiatour.live/attractions/da-nang):** Vietnam’s beach city with modern vibes and beautiful coastal views\n- **Ba Na Hills & [Golden Bridge](https://indiatour.live/attractions/golden-hand-bridge):** A surreal experience in the mountains with cable cars, gardens, and the iconic hand-held bridge\n\n### **Unique Vietnam Experiences You’ll Enjoy on This Trip**\n\n- Glide above misty forests on the famous **[Ba Na Hills](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ba-na-hills) cable car ride**\n- Walk across the spectacular **Golden Bridge**, held by giant stone hands\n- Row through the limestone cave systems of **Trang An in [Ninh Binh](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ninh-binh)**\n- Cruise along the UNESCO-listed **Halong Bay** with stunning views\n- Soak in **[Hanoi’s Old Quarter](https://indiatour.live/attractions/hanoi-old-quarter)**, full of culture, cafés, and charming chaos\n- Experience two diverse landscapes — from the capital’s history to the coast’s calm",
