      "overviewText": "The **Vietnam with Phu Quoc Group Trip** is a thoughtfully designed journey that brings together Vietnam’s most iconic cities, natural wonders, and island experiences in one seamless itinerary. From the historic streets of Hanoi and the natural beauty of [Ha Long Bay](https://indiatour.live/attractions/halong-bay), to the coastal charm of Da Nang, the heritage lanes of [Hoi An](https://indiatour.live/attractions/hoi-an), and the tropical paradise of Phu Quoc, this trip offers a complete Vietnam experience.\n\nWhat makes this trip special is its balanced travel flow. You experience lively cities, scenic cruises, cultural towns, beaches, and island adventures—without feeling rushed. The itinerary is curated for travellers who want experiences, comfort, and connection, all while travelling with a group of like-minded people.\n\nThis group trip naturally attracts **solo travellers, female travellers, couples, and friends** who enjoy social travel, shared moments, and a relaxed yet well-organised journey. It’s ideal for travellers who want structure without rigidity and freedom without confusion.\n\n### **Why Book the Vietnam with Phu Quoc Group Trip**\n### \n- Covers **North, Central, and Island Vietnam** in one smooth itinerary\n- Includes Vietnam’s top highlights: city culture, UNESCO sites, beaches, cruises, and island hopping\n- Designed for **group travel with like-minded people**, making it social yet comfortable\n- Ideal for **solo and female travellers** looking for a safe international group trip\n- Mix of guided experiences, walking explorations, and leisure time\n- Perfect balance of **culture, nature, nightlife, and relaxation**\n\n\n### **Who Is This Vietnam with Phu Quoc Group Trip Ideal For**\n### \n- Solo travellers who want to explore Vietnam without travelling alone\n- Female travellers seeking safety, comfort, and a friendly group environment\n- Friends planning a multi-city international holiday\n- Couples who enjoy social, experience-led travel\n- First-time Vietnam travellers wanting clarity, pacing, and ease\n\nIf you want to explore only [Phu Quoc in Group](https://indiatour.live/tours/phu-quoc-group-trip) then this is your Itinerary!\n\n### **The Vibe of the Vietnam with Phu Quoc Group Trip**\n### \nExpect engaging city walks, scenic cruises, relaxed beach days, cultural evenings, and fun island experiences. Mornings are easy, days are immersive, and evenings are social but unforced. From lantern-lit rivers in Hoi An to island sunsets in [Phu Quoc](https://indiatour.live/attractions/phu-quoc), this trip is about shared experiences, good energy, and meaningful travel moments.\n\nAt the same time, the itinerary offers personal space and flexibility, allowing you to unwind, skip optional tours, or explore on your own when you feel like it.\n\nExplore all [Vietnam Itineraries](https://indiatour.live/vietnam) here!",
